{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ab407816-25cc-8b3b-b90f-26ebb6cbeca6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:02:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I need a marriage license. What I need to bring to you, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Both of you need to come in together, and each of you should bring a photo ID, like a driver's license or a passport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both people, same time. Okay. And the fee, how much it is? I want to bring the correct money."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to quote you a wrong number, so please check with the office before you come, or look on the city website. It's a set fee, and I can tell you we take cash or check at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cash or check. Understood. So I bring cash, and I leave the ID at home, because I pay with the cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, no, the opposite. Bring the ID, definitely. You need the ID and the payment both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, sorry. I was already writing it wrong. Bring the ID, and bring the payment also. Both things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If either of you was married before, bring the paperwork showing how that ended, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I was married before. So I bring the divorce paper. This is correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:01:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the divorce papers, that's right. We're open weekdays, and you can walk right in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:02:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. If I have a question, I call again. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Have a nice afternoon, and congratulations."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T14:02:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
